    {
      "id": "p08",
      "title": "云朵",
      "kind": "story",
      "image": "https://pbook-1252924514.cos.ap-guangzhou.myqcloud.com/books/drop/v2/images/08.jpg",
      "text": {
        "en": "Invisible, Drop bounces around the air for days. Abracadabra! When she gets colder, and less bouncy, she reappears from teeny-tiny droplets. Ta-daa! Her friends show up too! Drop and her friends like to get together and hang out. Bonding time! When a lot of them get together, they make clouds. Clouds are cool.",
        "zh": "小水滴变得看不见了，在空气里蹦跳好几天。\n“变个魔术！”\n冷下来、不再那么活跃时，她又以极小的水滴形态出现了。\n“当当！”\n朋友们也来了！小水滴和朋友喜欢聚在一起。\n“相聚时间！”\n许多小水滴聚到一起，就形成了云。\n“云可真酷！”"
      },
