    {
      "id": "p09",
      "title": "闪电",
      "kind": "story",
      "image": "https://pbook-1252924514.cos.ap-guangzhou.myqcloud.com/books/drop/v2/images/09.jpg",
      "text": {
        "en": "A crowded cloud can become quite an event! Drop and her friends bounce around so much that they create sparks! Eeeek! Their clouds turn electric! Zzzzt! Downright shocking! It can get loud and dark, but Drop hangs in there. We've got this! She knows it will all be worth it...",
        "zh": "一朵挤满水滴的云，可会变得很热闹！小水滴和朋友蹦跳得那么厉害，竟产生了火花！\n“呀！”\n云朵带上了电！\n“滋滋！”\n“真让人震惊！”\n天色可能变暗，声音可能很响，但小水滴坚持着。\n“我们能行！”\n她知道，这一切都会值得……"
      },
