      "text": {
        "en": "If she makes it to a mountain, she may slip into a stream, dive off a cliff, roll down a river, and land in a lake. Tickly trickly! Super Drop! Yes! Hi, new home!",
        "zh": "如果落在山上，她可能滑进小溪、从悬崖跃下、顺着河流滚动，最后落进湖泊。\n“痒痒的，涓涓流！”\n“超级小水滴！”\n“好耶！”\n“嗨，新家！”"
