      "text": {
        "en": "If she freezes into snow or ice, she may be stuck somewhere for thousands of years! Brrrr! Drop has been glaciers... Are we there yet? ...and icebergs... Guess I gotta be cool with this! ...for a long, long time.",
        "zh": "如果冻成了雪或冰，她可能在某个地方被困上几千年！\n“好冷啊！”\n小水滴当过冰川……\n“到了没有呀？”\n……也当过冰山……\n“看来我得冷静接受啦！”\n一待就是很久很久。"
      },
