    {
      "id": "p14",
      "title": "森林里的水",
      "kind": "story",
      "image": "https://pbook-1252924514.cos.ap-guangzhou.myqcloud.com/books/drop/v2/images/14.jpg",
      "text": {
        "en": "If she falls in a forest, she may trickle down a tree and soak into the soil. Hi, tree! She could sink down to the bedrock and rest with the groundwater. Zzz... Or she could get pulled in by roots, getting back to my roots! Sucked up through stems, up, up, up! And pushed out through a leaf! What a ride!",
        "zh": "如果落在森林里，她可能顺着树干流下，渗进土壤。\n“嗨，大树！”\n她可能深入到基岩，在地下水中休息。\n“呼……”\n也可能被树根吸进去。\n“回到根的怀抱！”\n沿着茎向上走。\n“上去，上去，上去！”\n再从叶子里释放出去！\n“多棒的旅程！”"
      },
