      "text": {
        "en": "Everywhere she flows, Drop keeps things moving. She even moves through plants and animals. Drop travels from flower nectar to bees and butterflies. So busy! Look at those wings! She fills fruit with juice for birds and bears. Mmmmm! And you know who else?",
        "zh": "无论流到哪里，小水滴都让万物运转。她也会穿过植物和动物的身体。\n小水滴从花蜜来到蜜蜂和蝴蝶身上。\n“真忙呀！”\n“看看那些翅膀！”\n她把果实变得汁水充盈，供鸟儿和熊享用。\n“嗯，真好吃！”\n你知道还有谁吗？"
      },
